<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies four muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies four muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following four municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Pennridge School District, Pa., $9.995 million general obligation bonds, by direct purchase.  </p>
<p>--Elkhorn, Wis., $925,000 taxable GO notes.</p>
<p>--Elkhorn, Wis., $2.85 million revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Elkhorn, Wis., $4.525 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
